<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>I find it better if you make Fortune 1-5 Strike manually as it gives more yield than letting the Coin Exchanger NPC do it in bulk.

How to use: 
1. Recommended resolution is 1400x1050 (windowed mode)
2. Put the Inventory + the enchant window on the Top Right corner. Like this --&gt; https://ibb.co/vrdJZnF
3. Put the Fortune Chip on the first slot and the Extreme Power on the second slot.Like this ---&gt;&gt; https://ibb.co/gMZ4vyG1
4. Start the macro and Enjoy!


PS: This only works for Fortune Strike Cubes 
</Description>
    <Comment>Feel free to message me!</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
